    "title": "Oregon State Parks end same-day refunds - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago Oregon State Parks will stop issuing refunds for same-day cancellations and no-shows starting April 1. The policy applies to camping, cabin and group site reservations. The agency is also launching resident passes with free year-round parking and up to four free camping nights monthly. Free parking will be offered June 6 for State Parks Day. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
